  m_Name: Hero_Orion_3Star
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HeroData
  heroName: Orion
  title: Novato de la Vanguardia
  origin: Reino Fronterizo
  bio: "Orion tomó la lanza de su padre, capitán de un fuerte fronterizo caído, y juró que no volvería a caer en su guardia. Pelea con la disciplina de quien no se permite fallar dos veces."
  bioEn: "Orion took up the spear of his father, a border captain who fell defending his post, and swore it would never fall again on his watch. He fights with the discipline of someone who won't allow himself to fail twice."
  bioJa: "陥落した国境砦の隊長だった父の槍を受け継いだオリオンは、二度と同じ轍を踏まないと誓った。二度の失敗を自分に許さない者の規律で戦う。"
  bodySprite: {fileID: 661127049300003630, guid: 1296ce6dafbf81a4a9bdc1f213e3963f, type: 3}
